  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "The number of terms common to the two A.P.&rsquo;s <math><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>407</mn></math> and <math><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>16</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>709</mn></math> is ____________.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "14",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Common Difference of first series&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>Common difference of second series&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p>First common term <math><mo>=</mo><mn>23</mn></math></p><p>Common difference <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>M</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>28</mn></math></p><p>To find number of common terms we put</p><p>Last term <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>407</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>23</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>28</mn><mi></mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>407</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>28</mn><mi></mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>384</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mi></mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>13.71</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>14.71</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn></math></p>",
